You already have the answers why not to kick doors down. So I give 
something else.

I got annoyed on having to confirm my action eg. answering questions 
'unlock the door?' and such, so I made a patch. Here is the description 
of that patch:

A boolean option 'confirm_unlocking' (default: true) handles the 
(un)locking of doors and lone containers.

TRUE:   Vanilla behavior.
FALSE:  (un)locking doors or lone containers is not confirme. If more
         than one container is in same location confirmation is done.

The patch changes also the command 'X'.

X         togggle two-weapon combat
M-X       enter explore mode
#explore  enter explore mode

Both parts are included or excluded on compile time by macros defined in 
config.h.

